From b5247d003ebf074df55b899dae0579c6cf696db2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 07:30:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 02/37] G4 cont4 checkpoint 1.2 (cont.): the right pass at
 every level; factoring

- The right pass and the return home are re-indexed by ZoneData: the
  last field of the right layout (zr_rightWord: the last zone, or the
  home at level zero) has the new half-capacity 2^l and is the ruler's
  source, so the pass and the return home hold at every level, l = 0
  included (zr_rightWord_length, zr_rightWord_word, zr_home_word).
  zr_RightData is removed; the right pass's statements now read l = D.1.
- zr_singleton_fields (the re-wrapping keeps every field) replaces the
  two near-identical zr_rightPassRow_pre/_post lemmas
  (zr_rightPassRow_eq); zr_bindState_eq (a redirected configuration's
  extensionality) shortens zr_dispatch_post and the round's body step.
- Region (c): the extension row's status paragraph updated.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0155fKrzMUhziJHzQxJacYbw
